37. That the accused applicant has applied for the bail under the Gangsters Act before the Hon'ble Court in Criminal Misc Bail Application No.32534 of 2023 and during the pendency of the bail application the Hon'ble Court has called for the medical report of the accused applicant wherein the Medical Superintendent, Central Jail,
Naini, Prayagraj has submitted through his report dated 09.08.2023 about the medical conditions of the accused applicant which is elaborated as under;
'The applicant was found suffering from 'Ear discharge, vertigo and headache with chronic suppurative otitis media with mastoiditis and was advised for operation".
